### Server API Tests
### Base URL
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@token = your_jwt_token_here

### 1. Get All Servers
GET {{baseUrl}}/servers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 2. Get Servers with Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/servers?page=1&pageSize=5
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 3. Get Servers with Search
GET {{baseUrl}}/servers?search=web
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 4. Get Servers with Status Filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/servers?status=ONLINE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. Get Servers with Type Filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/servers?type=PHYSICAL
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. Get Servers with Location Filter
GET {{baseUrl}}/servers?location=DC
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. Get Servers with Multiple Filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/servers?status=ONLINE&type=PHYSICAL&location=DC
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Get Server Configuration Options
GET {{baseUrl}}/servers/config
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Find Servers by Name
GET {{baseUrl}}/servers/find?name=Web Server 1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 10. Find Servers by IP Address
GET {{baseUrl}}/servers/find?ip_address=192.168.1.100
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 11. Find Servers (No Criteria - Should Fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/servers/find
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 12. Find Servers (Non-existent - Should Return Empty)
GET {{baseUrl}}/servers/find?name=NonExistentServer
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. Get Server by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/servers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14. Get Non-existent Server (Should Fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/servers/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15. Create Server (Minimal)
POST {{baseUrl}}/servers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Server 1",
  "ip_addresses": [1]
}

### 16. Create Server (Full)
POST {{baseUrl}}/servers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Server 2",
  "os": 1,
  "status": "ONLINE",
  "location": "DC",
  "type": "PHYSICAL",
  "managers": [1],
  "systems": [1],
  "agents": [1],
  "services": [1],
  "tags": [1],
  "ip_addresses": [2],
  "description": "Test server for API testing"
}

### 17. Create Server (Missing Name - Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/servers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "ip_addresses": [1]
}

### 18. Create Server (Duplicate Name - Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/servers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Server 1",
  "ip_addresses": [3]
}

### 19. Create Server (No IP Addresses - Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/servers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test Server 3"
}

### 20. Create Server (Invalid Platform ID - Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/servers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
