### 48. Delete Server
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/servers/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 49. Delete Non-existent Server (Should Fail)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/servers/99999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 50. Test Authentication (No Token - Should Fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/servers

### 51. Test Authentication (Invalid Token - Should Fail)
GET {{baseUrl}}/servers
Authorization: Bearer invalid_token

### 52. Test Content Type (Wrong Content Type - Should Fail)
POST {{baseUrl}}/servers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: text/plain

{
  "name": "Wrong Content Type"
}

### 53. Test Large Description
POST {{baseUrl}}/servers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Server with Large Description",
  "ip_addresses": [14],
  "description": "This is a very long description that tests the system's ability to handle large text fields. It contains multiple sentences and should be properly stored and retrieved without any issues. The description field should support long text content and maintain proper formatting when displayed. This server provides various services and can be used in different environments."
}

### 54. Test Special Characters in Name
POST {{baseUrl}}/servers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Server with Special Chars: @#$%^&*()",
  "ip_addresses": [15],
  "description": "Testing special characters in server name"
}

### 55. Test Unicode Characters
POST {{baseUrl}}/servers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Server with Unicode: 测试服务器",
  "ip_addresses": [16],
  "description": "Testing Unicode characters in server name and description"
}

### 56. Test Array Parameters in Query
GET {{baseUrl}}/servers?tags=1&tags=2&ip=1&ip=2&manager=1&manager=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 57. Test Complex Filtering
GET {{baseUrl}}/servers?search=test&status=ONLINE&type=PHYSICAL&location=DC&tags=1&ip=1&manager=1&systems=1&services=1&os=1&page=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 58. Test Edge Case - Empty Arrays
POST {{baseUrl}}/servers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Server with Empty Arrays",
  "ip_addresses": [17],
  "managers": [],
  "systems": [],
  "agents": [],
  "services": [],
  "tags": []
}

### 59. Test Edge Case - Null Values
POST {{baseUrl}}/servers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Server with Null Values",
  "ip_addresses": [18],
  "description": null,
  "os": null
}

### 60. Test Edge Case - Whitespace Handling
POST {{baseUrl}}/servers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "  Server with Whitespace  ",
  "ip_addresses": [19],
  "description": "  Description with whitespace  "
}